&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;3+ years of Enterprise Cybersecurity SaaS sales experience with a strong emphasis on net-new logo acquisition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
